{#
    A YouTube player embedded in a text.

    The ratio classes come from Bootstrap and keep the frame at 16:9 whatever the width of the
    column is; an iframe of its own has a fixed size of 300x150.

    @var src string The address of the player, built by YoutubeEmbedProvider.
#}
<div class="ratio ratio-16x9 my-2">
    <iframe src="{{ src }}" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" loading="lazy"></iframe>
</div>
